## Infrastructure

Terraform in `infra/`, state in `s3://{{ tf_state_bucket }}/{{ project_name }}/`.

```bash
set -a; source .env; set +a
terraform -chdir=infra init
terraform -chdir=infra plan
terraform -chdir=infra apply
```

Teardown: `terraform -chdir=infra destroy`.
